#: ../../source/classes/class_fmodsystem.rst:16 8aa09b14fb91455d8a606429bd49bd6c
msgid "Wrapper class for the FMOD::System object, providing audio system management and control."
msgstr "FMOD::System 对象的包装类，提供音频系统管理和控制"

#: ../../source/classes/class_fmodsystem.rst:21 b1728b8e9192419fb69137189c5dea07
msgid "Description"
msgstr "描述"

#: ../../source/classes/class_fmodsystem.rst:23 efd9ac8f768b4512a5ee3f429755d997
msgid ""
"FmodSystem wraps the FMOD Core API's FMOD::System object and provides comprehensive audio system "
"management capabilities. This class handles system initialization, audio device management, sound"
" creation, playback control, and recording functionality."
msgstr ""
"**FmodSystem**    封装了 FMOD 核心 API 的 FMOD::System "
"对象，并提供全面的音频系统管理功能。该类负责系统初始化、音频设备管理、声音创建、播放控制以及录音功能。"

#: ../../source/classes/class_fmodsystem.rst:25 561d6b5b19db467890a6b060c721f7a5
msgid ""
"The FMOD System is the core of the FMOD audio engine. It manages the mixer, channels, sounds, DSP"
" effects, and output devices. You can create multiple System instances for advanced use cases, or"
" use the global singleton via :ref:`FmodServer<class_FmodServer>` for typical applications."
msgstr ""
"FMOD System 是 FMOD 音频引擎的核心。它管理混音器、音轨、声音、DSP 效果和输出设备。对于高级应用场景，可以创建多个    **FmodSystem**    "
"实例；对于常规应用，则可以通过    :ref:`FmodServer<class_FmodServer>`    使用全局单例。"

