#: ../../source/classes/class_fmodsystem.rst:406 87194fc1e72c4a8690645b8927bd3c2c
msgid ""
"Enables TCP/IP profiling host, allowing FMOD Studio or FMOD Profiler to connect and view memory, "
"CPU, and DSP graphs in real-time."
msgstr "启用基于TCP/IP的主机，允许FMOD Studio或FMOD Profiler连接，实时查看内存、CPU 和 DSP 图表"

#: ../../source/classes/class_fmodsystem.rst:412 5439a082878b48dba710b58fd72d71fd
